---
import ArrowLoop from '../components/ArrowLoop.astro';
import RollLabel from '../components/RollLabel.astro';
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Picture from '../components/Picture.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
import { media,services } from '../data/projects';
---
<Site title="Services" description="Strategic diagnosis, creative direction, campaign production and ongoing collaboration with Ahren Steis and Black Crowe Productions.">
 <section class="page-intro wrap"><h1>HOW WE<br/>WORK.</h1><p>Start with what the audience needs.<br/>Build the right work around it.</p></section>
 <div class="services-image"><Picture src={media.studio} alt="Production control monitors and camera team behind the scenes" eager /></div>
 <section class="service-details wrap section-space">{services.map((s,i)=><article data-reveal><h2>{s.title}</h2><div><p class="service-lead">{s.description}</p><ul>{s.items.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><p class="service-example">{s.example}</p><a class="text-link" href={`/contact/?service=${['strategy','production','continuity'][i]}`}><RollLabel text={`Discuss ${['strategy','a production','ongoing work'][i]}`} /><ArrowLoop /></a></div></article>)}</section>
 <section class="process-section wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><h2>From the first question<br/>to the finished work.</h2></div><ol class="process-list"><li><h3>Diagnose</h3><p>Identify the communication gap and the decision the work needs to support.</p></li><li><h3>Define</h3><p>Agree on the message, evidence, creative direction and scope.</p></li><li><h3>Produce</h3><p>Bring together the people and production needed for the assignment.</p></li><li><h3>Deploy</h3><p>Prepare the finished assets for their intended use across sales, web and social.</p></li></ol></section>
 <section class="faq-section wrap section-space"><h2>Before we begin.</h2><div><details><summary>Do I need a finished brief?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Start with what is difficult to communicate and what the work needs to accomplish. The brief can take shape through the initial conversation.</p></details><details><summary>Can you join an existing production?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Yes. Black Crowe can assemble a full production or contribute within an existing agency, company or production team. The role is defined around the assignment.</p></details><details><summary>What does a project cost?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Scope depends on the communication problem, production needs, deliverables and schedule. Those details are established before a proposal is made.</p></details><details><summary>Who leads the work?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Ahren leads strategic diagnosis and creative direction. Black Crowe Productions brings together the production team required to carry out the work.</p></details></div></section>
 <ContactBand />
</Site>
